@startuml seq-login
title Login — Sanctum SPA cookie + CSRF
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "Laravel API" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n(sessions)" as DB

User -> SPA : open app
SPA -> API : GET /sanctum/csrf-cookie
API --> SPA : Set-Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN (readable),\nlaravel_session (HttpOnly)
User -> SPA : email + password
SPA -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/login\nHeader X-XSRF-TOKEN\n(cookie sent automatically)
API -> API : throttle 5/min (email+IP)\nverify CSRF
API -> DB : find user; check bcrypt hash;\ncheck status != suspended
alt credentials valid
  API -> DB : regenerate session id;\nstore user id in session
  API --> SPA : 200 {data: user}\nSet-Cookie: new laravel_session
  SPA -> SPA : store user in TanStack Query cache;\nredirect by role
else invalid / suspended
  API --> SPA : 422 / 403 message
end

== Later requests ==
SPA -> API : GET /api/v1/... (cookie + X-XSRF-TOKEN)
API -> API : auth:sanctum resolves user from session\n-> role middleware -> Policy
API --> SPA : 200 / 401 / 403
@enduml
